1
00:00:00,298 --> 00:00:01,488
(Leonard:)That never happened once.

2
00:00:05,002 --> 00:00:08,372
(Raj:)I think the next time I have to speak
to a call center in India...

3
00:00:08,539 --> 00:00:11,009
(Raj:)...I'm going to try using
an American accent.

4
00:00:14,145 --> 00:00:15,635
(Howard:)Why?

5
00:00:15,847 --> 00:00:19,647
(Raj:)Because when I use my regular voice,
I feel like I'm making fun of them.

6
00:00:22,487 --> 00:00:25,687
(Howard:)That's ridiculous. Not to mention,
your American accent is terrible.

7
00:00:25,890 --> 00:00:28,020
(Raj:)Dude, my accent is brilliant.

8
00:00:28,226 --> 00:00:31,556
(Raj:)Hey, my snow-white
American friends, let's put some cow meat...

9
00:00:31,729 --> 00:00:34,999
(Raj:)...on the barbecue and eat it
until we're all obese.

10
00:00:37,001 --> 00:00:38,091
This is what you sound like:

11
00:00:38,269 --> 00:00:40,799
"I think I'm talking in an American accent...

12
00:00:40,972 --> 00:00:45,032
(Howard:)...but it really sounds like
I'm wearing a set of giant dentures."

13
00:00:45,910 --> 00:00:48,040
(Raj:)Sheldon, do I really sound like that?

14
00:00:48,312 --> 00:00:50,182
(Howard:)Tell him he sounds like that.

15
00:00:52,016 --> 00:00:53,846
(Raj:)Sheldon, you okay?

16
00:00:55,253 --> 00:00:57,013
(Sheldon:)It's been three days.

17
00:00:57,221 --> 00:01:01,021
(Sheldon:)Why hasn't Stephen Hawking
played a word?

